{"unit_id":"zczgagat__token2rice#card-zh","repo":"zczgagat/token2rice","commit":"158c242b44c40402b1c95e856d83b036cd52a17b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"token2rice 是一个面向 DSH Web 界面的用量可视化插件。它在宿主侧汇总各会话 assistant 消息中 provider 上报的 token 用量，保存累计账本，并在浏览器的窗口浮层里显示计数牌和动画。主要功能包括按累计用量生成掉落的米饭碗、拖动或清除碗、用漩涡吸入动画收起碗，以及调整每碗额度、显示数量和图片。适合希望把 DSH token 消耗直观看成轻松动画的用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号；账本写入 DSH_HOME 目录，界面设置保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:64-79","index.js:295-310","index.js:380-447","client.js:1310-1380","client.js:1780-1953","client.js:1982-1992"]}
{"unit_id":"zczgagat__token2rice#card-en","repo":"zczgagat/token2rice","commit":"158c242b44c40402b1c95e856d83b036cd52a17b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"token2rice is a DSH web plugin that turns reported token usage into animated rice bowls. It saves a local ledger and adds a counter to the window. Users can set thresholds, move or clear bowls, use a vortex animation, and customize artwork. No API key is needed; usage is stored under DSH_HOME.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:64-79","index.js:295-310","index.js:380-447","client.js:1310-1380","client.js:1780-1953","client.js:1982-1992"]}
