{"unit_id":"zczgagat__token2rice#feature-1","repo":"zczgagat/token2rice","commit":"158c242b44c40402b1c95e856d83b036cd52a17b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"token2rice 的功能「用量换米饭」：累计 provider 上报的 input、output 和缓存 token；达到设定额度时在 DSH 浮层生成米饭碗。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:64-79","client.js:1310-1380"]}
{"unit_id":"zczgagat__token2rice#feature-2","repo":"zczgagat/token2rice","commit":"158c242b44c40402b1c95e856d83b036cd52a17b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"token2rice 的功能「互动碗与漩涡」：用户可拖动米饭碗、双击移除，或点漩涡收起全部碗；把单碗拖到漩涡上也能单独吸入。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1234-1282","client.js:1310-1380","client.js:1945-1953"]}
{"unit_id":"zczgagat__token2rice#feature-3","repo":"zczgagat/token2rice","commit":"158c242b44c40402b1c95e856d83b036cd52a17b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"token2rice 的功能「计数牌与外观设置」：点击计数牌打开面板，可调每碗 token 额度、碗大小、数量上限和显示选项，也可上传 PNG、JPEG、WebP 或 GIF 图片。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1780-1841","client.js:1909-1943"]}
{"unit_id":"zczgagat__token2rice#feature-4","repo":"zczgagat/token2rice","commit":"158c242b44c40402b1c95e856d83b036cd52a17b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"token2rice 的功能「跨重启保留用量」：宿主把汇总账本写到 DSH_HOME/token2rice/state.json，启动时恢复累计数据；设置从插件首次启用起算。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:5-15","index.js:40-45","index.js:200-250"]}
{"unit_id":"zczgagat__token2rice#caveat-1","repo":"zczgagat/token2rice","commit":"158c242b44c40402b1c95e856d83b036cd52a17b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"token2rice 使用前须知：累计账本会保存在 DSH_HOME/token2rice/state.json；未设置 DSH_HOME 时目录回退到 ~/.dsh。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:40-45","index.js:200-250"]}
{"unit_id":"zczgagat__token2rice#caveat-2","repo":"zczgagat/token2rice","commit":"158c242b44c40402b1c95e856d83b036cd52a17b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"token2rice 使用前须知：只累计插件启用后 assistant 消息中 provider 实际报告的用量，未上报的 token 不会进入账本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:5-15","index.js:295-310"]}
